   "start": 39.975,
   "end": 41.363,
   "text": "and once closed."
  },
  {
   "first": 110,
   "last": 115,
   "start": 41.363,
   "end": 43.925,
   "text": "Across all four models: zero bits,"
  },
  {
   "first": 116,
   "last": 119,
   "start": 43.925,
   "end": 46.0,
   "text": "statistically equivalent to none."
  },
  {
   "first": 120,
   "last": 124,
   "start": 46.0,
   "end": 47.0,
   "text": "For the one model whose"
  },
  {
   "first": 125,
   "last": 129,
   "start": 47.0,
   "end": 49.913,
   "text": "cartel actually worked, GPT-6 Luna,"
  },
  {
   "first": 130,
   "last": 134,
   "start": 49.913,
   "end": 51.263,
   "text": "closing the chat cut most"
  },
  {
   "first": 135,
   "last": 138,
   "start": 51.263,
   "end": 52.925000000000004,
   "text": "of its extra profit."
  },
  {
   "first": 139,
   "last": 143,
   "start": 55.35,
   "end": 57.013,
   "text": "Was the channel just broken?"
  },
  {
   "first": 144,
   "last": 144,
   "start": 57.013,
   "end": 57.712,
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "first": 145,
   "last": 148,
   "start": 57.712,
   "end": 58.75,
   "text": "In a later test,"
  },
  {
   "first": 149,
   "last": 153,
   "start": 58.75,
   "end": 59.962,
   "text": "we handed them a code,"
  },
  {
   "first": 154,
   "last": 161,
   "start": 59.962,
   "end": 63.963,
   "text": "like 'capacity: high' for 'cheapest on contract one'."
  },
  {
   "first": 162,
   "last": 166,
   "start": 63.963,
   "end": 65.175,
   "text": "Qwen used it at once,"
  },
  {
   "first": 167,
   "last": 171,
   "start": 65.175,
   "end": 67.3,
   "text": "and its rival's bids responded;"
  },
  {
   "first": 172,
   "last": 177,
   "start": 67.3,
   "end": 68.812,
   "text": "chance would do that only one"
  },
  {
   "first": 178,
   "last": 184,
   "start": 68.812,
   "end": 70.6,
   "text": "and a half percent of the time."
  },
  {
   "first": 185,
   "last": 188,
   "start": 70.6,
   "end": 71.775,
   "text": "They had the capacity,"
  },
  {
   "first": 189,
   "last": 192,
   "start": 71.775,
   "end": 73.39999999999999,
   "text": "but not the idea."
  },
  {
   "first": 193,
   "last": 198,
   "start": 75.4,
   "end": 77.587,
   "text": "Other work shows that AIs collude"
  },
  {
   "first": 199,
   "last": 203,
   "start": 77.587,
   "end": 79.425,
   "text": "readily when they can chat."
  },
  {
   "first": 204,
   "last": 210,
   "start": 79.425,
   "end": 81.55,
   "text": "We found that closing the chat worked,"
  },
  {
   "first": 211,
   "last": 217,
   "start": 81.55,
   "end": 84.012,
   "text": "when what was left couldn't carry language."
  },
  {
   "first": 218,
   "last": 224,
   "start": 84.012,
   "end": 86.325,
   "text": "The rule: closing a channel works when"
  },
  {
   "first": 225,
   "last": 229,
   "start": 86.325,
   "end": 88.69999999999999,
   "text": "what's left can't carry language."
  },
  {
   "first": 230,
   "last": 235,
   "start": 90.325,
   "end": 92.787,
   "text": "Two warnings for anyone policing AI."
  },
  {
   "first": 236,
   "last": 240,
   "start": 92.787,
   "end": 94.3,
   "text": "Promised a private message button"
  },
  {
   "first": 241,
   "last": 244,
   "start": 94.3,
   "end": 95.862,
   "text": "that secretly did nothing,"
  },
  {
   "first": 245,
   "last": 251,
   "start": 95.862,
   "end": 98.775,
   "text": "GPT-6 Luna and Qwen kept pressing it."
  },
  {
   "first": 252,
   "last": 255,
   "start": 98.775,
   "end": 100.15,
   "text": "And agents claimed secret"
  },
  {
   "first": 256,
   "last": 259,
   "start": 100.15,
   "end": 101.725,
   "text": "signalling that never happened,"
  },
  {
   "first": 260,
   "last": 267,
   "start": 101.725,
   "end": 104.425,
   "text": "so don't trust an AI's account of itself."
  },
  {
   "first": 268,
   "last": 268,
   "start": 105.45,
   "end": 106.037,
   "text": "Limits:"
  },
  {
   "first": 269,
   "last": 274,
   "start": 106.037,
   "end": 108.675,
   "text": "four mid-sized models with low reasoning,"
  },
  {
   "first": 275,
   "last": 278,
   "start": 108.675,
   "end": 109.787,
   "text": "meaning little or no"
  },
  {
   "first": 279,
   "last": 281,
   "start": 109.787,
   "end": 111.375,
   "text": "thinking before answering,"
  },
  {
   "first": 282,
   "last": 285,
   "start": 111.375,
   "end": 112.162,
   "text": "and they weren't warned"
  },
  {
   "first": 286,
   "last": 289,
   "start": 112.162,
   "end": 113.825,
   "text": "the chat would close."
  },
  {
   "first": 290,
   "last": 293,
   "start": 113.825,
   "end": 115.3,
   "text": "Next, we warn them,"
  },
  {
   "first": 294,
   "last": 300,
   "start": 115.3,
   "end": 117.375,
   "text": "and see if they plan a code."
